OL,3,GNEWSATeacher jailed for taking upskirt
OL,4,Aphotos of pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former supply teacher has been jailed
OL,7,Ffor six years after taking more than
OL,8,F100 upskirt photographs of schoolgirls,
OL,9,Fincluding in his classroom, across
OL,10,FGreater Manchester.
OL,12,FAbusali Rahman, 37, from Salford, also
OL,13,Fused artificial intelligence (AI) to
OL,14,Fcreate sexualised fake images from
OL,15,Fpupils' social media photographs which
OL,16,Fhe shared online.
OL,18,FHe pleaded guilty to 21 offences,
OL,19,Fincluding taking indecent photographs
OL,20,Fof children and publishing obscene
OL,21,Fmaterial.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
